<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea says to seek 40,000 tonnes of soybean.</title>
<headline>S.Korea says to seek 40,000 tonnes of soybean.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's state-run Agricultural and Fishery Marketing Corp (AFMC) said on Monday it would invite tenders to buy 40,000 tonnes of No.1 soybean by 11:00 a.m. (0200 GMT) on July 15.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p> POSITION  TONNE	     SHIPMENT		ARRIVAL/PORT</p>
<p>			  U.S. GULF     U.S. PNW</p>
<p>  ONE     20,000   Jul 26-Aug 15  Aug 11-30   Sep 20/Inchon</p>
<p>  TWO     20,000   Aug 26-Sep 15  Sep 11-30   Oct 20/Inchon</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
